#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/11-basic_joint.md:39
#: 325914052c6945bfa1950a95d3e5ab12
msgid ""
"This demo declares **`type` only**. It does not declare `left_type` / "
"`right_type`. Mixed L/R EEF is on OCS2 `demo` / `split_body` / "
"`full_body` via "
"[robot_common_launch](../../4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md)."
msgstr ""
"此 demo **只声明 `type`**，没有 `left_type` / `right_type`。左右不同末端在 OCS2 的 `demo`"
" / `split_body` / `full_body` 上，见 "
"[robot_common_launch](../../4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/11-basic_joint.md:41
#: 06d6a26126c84b5f95ed99eb4953822c
msgid "Switch FSM"
msgstr "切换 FSM"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/11-basic_joint.md:43
#: 4ce7b119fdd7424596e6db4ef3cf82ca
msgid ""
"ros2 topic pub --once /fsm_command std_msgs/msg/Int32 \"data: 1\"   # "
"HOLD → HOME\n"
"ros2 topic pub --once /fsm_command std_msgs/msg/Int32 \"data: 2\"   # → "
"HOLD\n"
"ros2 topic pub --once /fsm_command std_msgs/msg/Int32 \"data: 4\"   # "
"HOLD → MOVEJ (canonical)"
msgstr ""
"ros2 topic pub --once /fsm_command std_msgs/msg/Int32 \"data: 1\"   # "
"HOLD → HOME\n"
"ros2 topic pub --once /fsm_command std_msgs/msg/Int32 \"data: 2\"   # → "
"HOLD\n"
"ros2 topic pub --once /fsm_command std_msgs/msg/Int32 \"data: 4\"   # "
"HOLD → MOVEJ (canonical)"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/11-basic_joint.md:43
#: fb5b8b5fef1b45fdbd3c0e7ddf90ac5a
msgid "Value"
msgstr "取值"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/11-basic_joint.md:43
#: de2a512e628c466a9c2f5a9cb24f899c
msgid "Action (README)"
msgstr "动作（README）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/11-basic_joint.md:43
#: d9bd17f948fa481d87c95dc5575cca76
msgid "`1`"
msgstr "`1`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/11-basic_joint.md:43
#: 69321bdbda4e4a3d9ee1747e252e3244
msgid "HOME (only from HOLD)"
msgstr "HOME（仅能从 HOLD 进入）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/11-basic_joint.md:43
#: 3600fd98d0834e289fd5847c6606f581
msgid "`2`"
msgstr "`2`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/11-basic_joint.md:43
#: 1d9fe0af253f490db5f873a08852c312
msgid "HOLD (from HOME / MOVEJ)"
msgstr "HOLD（从 HOME / MOVEJ 进入）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/11-basic_joint.md:43
#: 2bb3b6023b454dceae59b14886129f2c
msgid "`4`"
msgstr "`4`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/11-basic_joint.md:43
#: 45d9efe968684ce680b4e186db2927fd
msgid "MOVEJ (only from HOLD; same canonical value as the whole-body stack)"
msgstr "MOVEJ（仅能从 HOLD 进入；与全身栈相同的规范值）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/11-basic_joint.md:43
#: b3ae73e92da9468c97b8dcbf7ccd082b
msgid "`3`"
msgstr "`3`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/11-basic_joint.md:43
#: e8297468317b435099cb3d66ed3f7c9e
msgid ""
"MOVEJ if this controller is standalone; on mixed OCS2/WBC stacks `3` "
"means **OCS2**"
msgstr "本控制器独立运行时为 MOVEJ；在混合 OCS2/WBC 栈上 `3` 表示 **OCS2**"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/11-basic_joint.md:56
#: 68515a458cfe4e89bacd4e7b1faa2635
msgid ""
"MOVEJ returns only to HOLD (`2`). Full table and home-config `100`+ "
"commands: [Basic Joint Controller "
"reference](../../4-reference/controllers/7-basic_joint_controller.md)."
msgstr ""
"MOVEJ 只能回到 HOLD（`2`）。完整表与 home 构型 `100`+ 命令见 [`Basic Joint Controller` "
"参考](../../4-reference/controllers/7-basic_joint_controller.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/11-basic_joint.md:58
#: e761439115e04c1d989ebf089d3a299f
msgid "Command joints in MOVEJ"
msgstr "在 MOVEJ 中命令关节"

